{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2022-12-13 16:43:00', 'title': 'JPMORGAN CHASE DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF JPMORGAN CHASE & CO. (NYSE: JPM) (“JPMORGAN CHASE” OR THE “FIRM”) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE OUTSTANDING SHARES OF THE COMMON STOCK OF JPMORGAN CHASE. INFORMATION CAN BE FOUND ON THE FIRM'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE AT JPMORGANCHASE.COM/IR/NEWS."}